[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2712019521","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103931#issuecomment-2712019521","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103931","id":2712019521,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hpiJB","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-10T22:49:23Z","updated_at":"2025-03-10T22:49:23Z","body":"I prefer this syntax. Plus it makes it easier to replace VectorView. \r\n\r\nMy opinion is based mostly on keeping the code clean and readable for other developers. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2712019521/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2713058839","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103931#issuecomment-2713058839","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103931","id":2713058839,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6htf4X","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-11T08:00:20Z","updated_at":"2025-03-11T08:20:06Z","body":"Converting _anything_ to `Span` implicitly is a bit weird to me, because it basically creates infinite auto-conversions.\r\nIn particular, `Span(array)` will now be ambiguous to mean `Span<Array>` or `Span<Array::Element>`. I'm not sure we want this ambiguity. It may put the compiler against us for explicit Span() calls.\r\n\r\nConverting to draft over this; I think this needs to be discussed further before we merge this.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2713058839/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2715938688","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103931#issuecomment-2715938688","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103931","id":2715938688,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6h4e-A","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-11T23:20:51Z","updated_at":"2025-03-11T23:20:51Z","body":"@Ivorforce that's a good point. I wonder if we can do something to mitigate that risk while still allowing for the convenience of single element spans. \r\n\r\nRight now we use it in the renderer to avoid some silly patterns like:\r\n\r\n```\r\nVector<Color> colors;\r\ncolors.push_back(color);\r\nrd.draw_list_begin(...,...,colors);\r\n```\r\nThe above code has an unnecessary heap allocation and copy when, using VectorView we can just do\r\n```\r\nrd.draw_list_begin(...,...,color);\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2715938688/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]